dict(name='科隆舊城萊茵河防洪牆~Cologne Old Town Rhine floodwalls',country='德國~Germany',lat=50.94,lng=6.962,query='Cologne Rheingarten mobile flood walls'),
[['預警與決策','Warning and decision'],['庫存與運輸','Inventory and transport'],['組裝及基礎','Assembly and bases'],['閉合與抽排','Closure and pumping'],['演練與反饋','Exercises and feedback']],
'環境署技術報告版權日期為2011年八月，雖資料頁標題保留2010字樣，本課依全文區分出版日期與計畫名稱。比尤德利塞文河南區於2006年完成，2020年維護公告說明接縫與地面滲漏仍需持續管理；比爾斯角於2025年九月達營運完工，細部景觀工作當時仍續作。科隆官方營運資料另說明固定與活動防線按河水位分段配合。本課不複製這些城市的實際啟動門檻，歷史產品清單也不當作現行供應或認證。~The Environment Agency technical report carries an August 2011 copyright date, although its landing-page title retains 2010; this course distinguishes the document date from that label. Severnside South completed in 2006, and a 2020 maintenance release shows continuing management of joints and ground seepage. Beales Corner reached operational completion in September 2025 while minor landscaping continued. Cologne’s operator separately describes staged interaction of fixed and mobile defences with river level. The course copies no city operating trigger and treats historical product listings as neither current availability nor certification.',
[dict(year='2011',event='環境署八月技術報告發布，涵蓋部署提前量與操作可靠度。~The Environment Agency August report covers deployment lead time and operational reliability.'),dict(year='2020',event='比尤德利公告接縫與地面滲漏維護，呈現持續保養需求。~Bewdley maintenance addresses joints and ground seepage, demonstrating continuing upkeep.'),dict(year='2025',event='九月比爾斯角達營運完工，結合固定牆與可拆構件。~Beales Corner reaches operational completion in September with fixed and removable elements.')],
